---
import Legal from '../components/Legal.astro';
import { PAGES } from '../data/pages';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---
<Legal page={PAGES.refunds} heading="Refund policy" updated="November 2026">
  <p>Every purchase comes with a <strong>14-day money-back guarantee</strong>. If your download doesn't work, or the wallpapers aren't what you expected, for any reason, including a change of mind, we refund you in full.</p>

  <h2>How to ask for a refund</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> within 14 days of your purchase.</li>
    <li>Write from, or tell us, the email you used at checkout so we can find your order.</li>
    <li>You don't need to give a reason, and there is nothing to send back: digital files can't be returned.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What happens next</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A real person replies within one working day, Monday to Friday.</li>
    <li>The refund goes back to your original payment method, in full. There are no fees.</li>
    <li>Banks usually show the refund within 5 to 10 business days.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Exchanges</h2>
  <p>We don't do exchanges. If you would rather have a different collection, we refund the first one and you buy the one you want.</p>

  <p>For how and when your files are delivered, see our <a href="/shipping">delivery policy</a>.</p>
</Legal>
